('SRV-71362804','kotoyali-model-thana-sylhet-city','কোতোয়ালী মডেল থানা','Kotoali Model Thana',NULL,40,41,'public',10005,20036,NULL,NULL,50006,NULL,NULL,NULL,24.888608,91.865938,ARRAY['01320-067568']::text[],'ockotsmp@police.gov.bd','https://smp.police.gov.bd/',NULL,'{"_sources": ["SYLHET_METRO_POLICE_THANAS_2026", "BD_POLICE_CONTACTS_2020_SYLHET", "WIKIDATA_SYL_2026"]}'::jsonb,'unverified',246,'upazila_en holds the SMP metropolitan thana (not an upazila). Name as on SMP''s home page ('', সিলেট'' dropped); thana from SMP''s ''এক নজরে''. SMP publishes no thana phone number or e-mail (no OC cards; its contact pages give only the HQ, control room and hotline), so none is given. SMP says its area includes ''27 wards of Sylhet City Corporation, 08 Unions of Sylhet Sadar Upazila and 10 Unions of South Surma Upazilla'' (SMP এক নজরে) without saying which thana covers which wards or unions, and Sylhet City Corporation (scc.gov.bd, 42 wards) names no thanas, so no official source places an SMP thana in the city corporation and area_en is left empty.','2026-11-12','official',246,true),
